#: taxocommerce-connections.php
msgid "TaxoCommerce Connections (Compatibility Bridge)"
msgstr "TaxoCommerce Connections (puente de compatibilidad)"

#. Description of the plugin
#: taxocommerce-connections.php
msgid ""
"Temporary compatibility bridge. External connections now live inside "
"TaxoCommerce Insights."
msgstr "Puente temporal de compatibilidad. Las conexiones externas ahora están integradas en TaxoCommerce Insights."

